text":["Gemini API 키를 붙여넣고 Enter: ··········\n","✅ 생성 모델 : models/gemini-flash-lite-latest\n","✅ 임베딩 모델 : models/gemini-embedding-2-preview\n","   (사용 가능한 생성 모델 37개 / 임베딩 3개)\n"]}],"source":["from getpass import getpass\n","from google import genai\n","from google.genai import types\n","\n","API_KEY = getpass(\"Gemini API 키를 붙여넣고 Enter: \").strip()\n","client = genai.Client(api_key=API_KEY)\n","\n","# 지금 내 계정에서 쓸 수 있는 모델을 직접 조회해서 고릅니다 (모델명이 바뀌어도 안전)\n","all_models = list(client.models.list())\n","gen_pool = [m.name for m in all_models\n","            if m.supported_actions and \"generateContent\" in m.supported_actions]\n","emb_pool = [m.name for m in all_models\n","            if m.supported_actions and \"embedContent\" in m.supported_actions]\n","\n","def pick(pool, prefer):\n","    for key in prefer:\n","        hit = sorted([n for n in pool if key in n.lower()])\n","        if hit:\n","            return hit[-1]\n","    return pool[0] if pool else None\n","\n","GEN_MODEL = pick(gen_pool, [\"flash-lite\", \"flash\"])\n","EMB_MODEL = pick(emb_pool, [\"gemini-embedding\", \"text-embedding\", \"embedding\"])\n","\n","print(f\"✅ 생성 모델 : {GEN_MODEL}\")\n","print(f\"✅ 임베딩 모델 : {EMB_MODEL}\")\n","print(f\"   (사용 가능한 생성 모델 {len(gen_pool)}개 / 임베딩 {len(emb_pool)}개)\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"YD34h_U0_hG2"},"source":["## 3. 규정집 PDF 올리기\n","\n","▶ 를 누르면 **[파일 선택]** 버튼이 나옵니다.\n","**「2019 고객응대근로자 건강보호 업종별 매뉴얼 — 콜센터 상담원」** PDF를 고르세요.\n","(다른 규정집이어도 됩니다. 여러 개 올려도 됩니다.)"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":186},"id":"qNJGsHXT_hG2","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787745354844,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":63132,"user":{"displayName":"낑깡","userId":"05215753437445767806"}},"outputId":"66334cc0-afc1-4f88-d3c9-611fb712b594"},"execution_count":7,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.HTML object>"],"text/html":["\n","     <input type=\"file\" id=\"files-45fde3d3-ecda-4f78-99c7-1051589d9f25\" name=\"files[]\" multiple disabled\n","        style=\"border:none\" />\n","     <output id=\"result-45fde3d3-ecda-4f78-99c7-1051589d9f25\">\n","      Upload widget is only available when the cell has been executed in the\n","      current browser session. Please rerun this cell to enable.\n","      </output>\n","      <script>// Copyright 2017 Google LLC\n","//\n","// Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the \"License\");\n","// you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.\n","// You may obtain a copy of the License at\n","//\n","//      http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\n","//\n","// Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software\n","// distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\" BASIS,\n","// WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.\n","// See the License for the specific language governing permissions and\n","// limitations under the License.\n","\n","/**\n"," * @fileoverview Helpers for google.colab Python module.\n"," */\n","(function(scope) {\n","function span(text, styleAttributes = {}) {\n","  const element = document.createElement('span');\n","  element.textContent = text;\n","  for (const key of Object.keys(styleAttributes)) {\n","    element.style[key] = styleAttributes[key];\n","  }\n","  return element;\n","}\n","\n","// Max number of bytes which will be uploaded at a time.\n","const MAX_PAYLOAD_SIZE = 100 * 1024;\n","\n","function _uploadFiles(inputId, outputId) {\n","  const steps = uploadFilesStep(inputId, outputId);\n","  const outputElement = document.getElementById(outputId);\n","  // Cache steps on the outputElement to make it available for the next call\n","  // to uploadFilesContinue from Python.\n","  outputElement.steps = steps;\n","\n","  return _uploadFilesContinue(outputId);\n","}\n","\n","// This is roughly an async generator (not supported in the browser yet),\n","// where there are multiple asynchronous steps and the Python side is going\n","// to poll for completion of each step.\n","// This uses a Promise to block the python side on completion of each step,\n","// then passes the result of the previous step as the input to the next step.\n","function _uploadFilesContinue(outputId) {\n","  const outputElement = document.getElementById(outputId);\n","  const steps = outputElement.steps;\n","\n","  const next = steps.next(outputElement.lastPromiseValue);\n","  return Promise.resolve(next.value.promise).then((value) => {\n","    // Cache the last promise value to make it available to the next\n","    // step of the generator.\n","    outputElement.lastPromiseValue = value;\n","    return next.value.response;\n","  });\n","}\n","\n","/**\n"," * Generator function which is called between each async step of the upload\n"," * process.\n"," * @param {string} inputId Element ID of the input file picker element.\n"," * @param {string} outputId Element ID of the output display.\n"," * @return {!Iterable<!Object>} Iterable of next steps.\n"," */\n","function* uploadFilesStep(inputId, outputId) {\n","  const inputElement = document.getElementById(inputId);\n","  inputElement.disabled = false;\n","\n","  const outputElement = document.getElementById(outputId);\n","  outputElement.innerHTML = '';\n","\n","  const pickedPromise = new Promise((resolve) => {\n","    inputElement.addEventListener('change', (e) => {\n","      resolve(e.target.files);\n","    });\n","  });\n","\n","  const cancel = document.createElement('button');\n","  inputElement.parentElement.appendChild(cancel);\n","  cancel.textContent = 'Cancel upload';\n","  const cancelPromise = new Promise((resolve) => {\n","    cancel.onclick = () => {\n","      resolve(null);\n","    };\n","  });\n","\n","  // Wait for the user to pick the files.\n","  const files = yield {\n","    promise: Promise.race([pickedPromise, cancelPromise]),\n","    response: {\n","      action: 'starting',\n","    }\n","  };\n","\n","  cancel.remove();\n","\n","  // Disable the input element since further picks are not allowed.\n","  inputElement.disabled = true;\n","\n","  if (!files) {\n","    return {\n","      response: {\n","        action: 'complete',\n","      }\n","    };\n","  }\n","\n","  for (const file of files) {\n","    const li = document.createElement('li');\n","    li.append(span(file.name, {fontWeight: 'bold'}));\n","    li.append(span(\n","        `(${file.type || 'n/a'}) - ${file.size} bytes, ` +\n","        `last modified: ${\n","            file.lastModifiedDate ? file.lastModifiedDate.toLocaleDateString() :\n","                                    'n/a'} - `));\n","    const percent = span('0% done');\n","    li.appendChild(percent);\n","\n","    outputElement.appendChild(li);\n","\n","    const fileDataPromise = new Promise((resolve) => {\n","      const reader = new FileReader();\n","      reader.onload = (e) => {\n","        resolve(e.target.result);\n","      };\n","      reader.readAsArrayBuffer(file);\n","    });\n","    // Wait for the data to be ready.\n","    let fileData = yield {\n","      promise: fileDataPromise,\n","      response: {\n","        action: 'continue',\n","      }\n","    };\n","\n","    // Use a chunked sending to avoid message size limits. See b/62115660.\n","    let position = 0;\n","    do {\n","      const length = Math.min(fileData.byteLength - position, MAX_PAYLOAD_SIZE);\n","      const chunk = new Uint8Array(fileData, position, length);\n","      position += length;\n","\n","      const base64 = btoa(String.fromCharCode.apply(null, chunk));\n","      yield {\n","        response: {\n","          action: 'append',\n","          file: file.name,\n","          data: base64,\n","        },\n","      };\n","\n","      let percentDone = fileData.byteLength === 0 ?\n","          100 :\n","          Math.round((position / fileData.byteLength) * 100);\n","      percent.textContent = `${percentDone}% done`;\n","\n","    } while (position < fileData.byteLength);\n","  }\n","\n","  // All done.\n","  yield {\n","    response: {\n","      action: 'complete',\n","    }\n","  };\n","}\n","\n","scope.google = scope.google || {};\n","scope.google.colab = scope.google.colab || {};\n","scope.google.colab._files = {\n","  _uploadFiles,\n","  _uploadFilesContinue,\n","};\n","})(self);\n","</script> "]},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Saving [2021-사업총괄본부-694]_감정노동 종사자 건강보호 가이드(웹용).pdf to [2021-사업총괄본부-694]_감정노동 종사자 건강보호 가이드(웹용) (1).pdf\n","Saving corpus_KT약관_제13조포함.txt to corpus_KT약관_제13조포함.txt\n","\n","[OK] 2개 파일에서 본문 있는 111쪽/절을 읽었습니다\n","   - [2021-사업총괄본부-694]_감정노동 종사자 건강보호 가이드(웹용) (1).pdf : 103\n","   - corpus_KT약관_제13조포함.txt : 8\n"]}],"source":["from google.colab import files\n","import pdfplumber, io, re\n","\n","uploaded = files.upload()\n","\n","docs = []   # [{\"doc\": 파일명, \"page\": 쪽/절, \"text\": 본문}]\n","for fname, data in uploaded.items():\n","    low = fname.lower()\n","\n","    if low.endswith(\".pdf\"):\n","        with pdfplumber.open(io.BytesIO(data)) as pdf:\n","            for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages, start=1):\n","                t = page.extract_text() or \"\"\n","                t = re.sub(r\"[ \\t]+\", \" \", t).strip()\n","                if len(t) > 30:\n","                    docs.append({\"doc\": fname, \"page\": i, \"text\": t})\n","\n","    elif low.endswith(\".txt\"):                      # <- 새로 넣는 부분\n","        body = data.decode(\"utf-8\", errors=\"ignore\")\n","        parts = re.split(r\"\\n=====.*?=====\\n\", body)   # ===== 절 ===== 단위로 나눔\n","        for i, t in enumerate(parts, start=1):\n","            t = re.sub(r\"[ \\t]+\", \" \", t).strip()\n","            if len(t) > 30:\n","                docs.append({\"doc\": fname, \"page\": i, \"text\": t})\n","\n","    else:\n","        print(f\"건너뜀(PDF/TXT 아님): {fname}\")\n","\n","print(f\"\\n[OK] {len(uploaded)}개 파일에서 본문 있는 {len(docs)}쪽/절을 읽었습니다\")\n","from collections import Counter\n","for d, n in Counter(x[\"doc\"] for x in docs).items():\n","    print(f\"   - {d} : {n}\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"ayh507fl_hG2"},"source":["## 4. 청킹 — 문단 단위로 자르기\n","\n","규정집을 통째로 넣으면 검색이 안 되니 **300자 안팎으로 자릅니다.**\n","잘린 조각(chunk) 하나하나가 나중에 \"근거\"가 됩니다."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":0},"id":"L1EWYBQZ_hG3","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787745643194,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":43,"user":{"displayName":"낑깡","userId":"05215753437445767806"}},"outputId":"86b37de4-85cf-438a-b581-5e8def5bb226"},"execution_count":8,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["✅ 총 430개 조각으로 잘랐습니다.\n","\n","--- 예시 (3번째 조각) ---\n","[[2021-사업총괄본부-694]_감정노동 종사자 건강보호 가이드(웹용) (1).pdf 2쪽]\n","무관련성과 고객 등 제3자의 판단 49\n","2. 일반근로자 건강보호에 필요한 기본사항 51\n","3. 일반근로자 건강보호 예방조치 56\n","4. 일반근로자 건강보호 사후조치 59\n","Ⅳ 참고자료 71\n","1. 감정노동 근로자 건강장해 예방관련 교육 내용 71\n","2. 건강장해 관련 치료 및 상담 자원 76\n","3. 감정노동 근로자 건강장해 발생 평가표 80\n","4. 감정노동 관련 참고 법령 85\n","5. 부록 92\n","02\n"]}],"source":["CHUNK_SIZE, OVERLAP = 300, 50\n","\n","chunks = []\n","for d in docs:\n","    body = d[\"text\"]\n","    start = 0\n","    while start < len(body):\n","        piece = body[start:start + CHUNK_SIZE]\n","        if len(piece.strip()) > 40:\n","            chunks.append({\n","                \"id\": f\"c{len(chunks):04d}\",\n","                \"text\": piece.strip(),\n","                \"doc\": d[\"doc\"],\n","                \"page\": d[\"page\"],\n","            })\n","        start += CHUNK_SIZE - OVERLAP\n","\n","print(f\"✅ 총 {len(chunks)}개 조각으로 잘랐습니다.\")\n","print(f\"\\n--- 예시 (3번째 조각) ---\\n[{chunks[2]['doc']} {chunks[2]['page']}쪽]\\n{chunks[2]['text']}\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"k_dJBAyD_hG3"},"source":["## 5. 임베딩 + 색인 — 좌표로 바꿔 창고에 넣기\n","\n","각 조각을 **숫자 좌표(벡터)** 로 바꿔서 저장합니다. 뜻이 비슷한 조각끼리 가까운 좌표를 갖게 됩니다.\n","동시에 **BM25**(단어가 정확히 일치하는지 보는 옛날 방식) 색인도 같이 만듭니다.\n","→ 두 방식을 합치는 게 사양서의 **하이브리드 검색**입니다.\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import numpy as np, time, re\n","\n","# ---------- (1) 벡터 임베딩 — 무료 한도(분당 100건)에 맞춰 속도 조절 ----------\n","RPM = 80                      # 분당 요청 수 — 한도 100보다 낮게 잡습니다\n","INTERVAL = 60.0 / RPM         # 요청 사이 간격 0.75초\n","\n","def embed(texts, task):\n","    out = []\n","    for n, t in enumerate(texts, 1):\n","        ok = False\n","        for attempt in range(6):\n","            try:\n","                r = client.models.embed_content(\n","                    model=EMB_MODEL, contents=t,\n","                    config=types.EmbedContentConfig(task_type=task))\n","                out.append(r.embeddings[0].values)\n","                ok = True\n","                break\n","            except Exception as ex:\n","                msg = str(ex)\n","                if \"429\" in msg or \"RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\" in msg:\n","                    wait = 30 * (attempt + 1)          # 30 -> 60 -> 90 ...\n","                    print(f\"\\n  [대기] 한도에 걸려 {wait}초 쉽니다  ({n}/{len(texts)})\")\n","                else:\n","                    wait = 5\n","                    print(f\"\\n  [오류] {wait}초 쉬고 다시 : {msg[:70]}\")\n","                time.sleep(wait)\n","        if not ok:\n","            raise RuntimeError(\n","                f\"{n}번째 조각에서 6번 모두 실패했습니다. \"\n","                f\"10분쯤 기다렸다 5번을 다시 돌리거나 로컬 모델로 바꾸세요.\")\n","        time.sleep(INTERVAL)\n","        if n % 10 == 0 or n == len(texts):\n","            left = (len(texts) - n) * INTERVAL / 60\n","            print(f\"  임베딩 {n}/{len(texts)}  ({n/len(texts)*100:.0f}%)  남은 시간 약 {left:.1f}분   \", end=\"\\r\")\n","    print()\n","    return np.array(out, dtype=\"float32\")\n","\n","print(f\"임베딩 중... 조각 {len(chunks)}개  (예상 {len(chunks)*INTERVAL/60:.1f}분)\")\n","EMB = embed([c[\"text\"] for c in chunks], \"RETRIEVAL_DOCUMENT\")\n","EMB = EMB / np.linalg.norm(EMB, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n","\n","assert EMB.shape[0] == len(chunks), f\"[X] 벡터 {EMB.shape[0]}개 != 조각 {len(chunks)}개\"\n","print(f\"\\n[OK] 벡터 {EMB.shape[0]}개 (차원 {EMB.shape[1]}) - 조각 수와 일치\")\n","\n","# ---------- (2) 벡터 저장소 ----------\n","BACKEND = \"numpy\"\n","try:\n","    import chromadb\n","    chroma = chromadb.Client()\n","    try:\n","        chroma.delete_collection(\"deundeun\")\n","    except Exception:\n","        pass\n","    col = chroma.get_or_create_collection(\n","        \"deundeun\", metadata={\"hnsw:space\": \"cosine\"})\n","    col.add(ids=[c[\"id\"] for c in chunks],\n","            embeddings=EMB.tolist(),\n","            documents=[c[\"text\"] for c in chunks],\n","            metadatas=[{\"doc\": c[\"doc\"], \"page\": c[\"page\"]} for c in chunks])\n","    BACKEND = \"Chroma\"\n","except Exception as ex:\n","    print(f\"(Chroma 사용 불가 -> numpy 코사인으로 대체: {type(ex).__name__})\")\n","print(f\"[OK] 벡터 저장소 : {BACKEND}\")\n","\n","# ---------- (3) BM25 색인 ----------\n","from rank_bm25 import BM25Okapi\n","try:\n","    from kiwipiepy import Kiwi\n","    _kiwi = Kiwi()\n","    def tok(s):\n","        return [t.form for t in _kiwi.tokenize(s) if t.tag[0] in (\"N\",\"V\",\"S\",\"X\")]\n","    TOKENIZER = \"kiwipiepy(형태소)\"\n","except Exception:\n","    def tok(s):\n","        s2 = re.sub(r\"[^가-힣A-Za-z0-9 ]\", \" \", s)\n","        w = [x for x in s2.split() if x]\n","        j = s2.replace(\" \", \"\")\n","        return w + [j[i:i+2] for i in range(len(j)-1)]\n","    TOKENIZER = \"글자 2-gram(대체)\"\n","\n","bm25 = BM25Okapi([tok(c[\"text\"]) for c in chunks])\n","print(f\"[OK] BM25 색인 완료 · 토크나이저 : {TOKENIZER}\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":0},"id":"EZ74O9kVEAnE","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787747077069,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":421345,"user":{"displayName":"낑깡","userId":"05215753437445767806"}},"outputId":"1205d15a-9961-4cb0-9350-e6430f4d78d3"},"execution_count":11,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["임베딩 중... 조각 430개  (예상 5.4분)\n","  임베딩 430/430  (100%)  남은 시간 약 0.0분   \n","\n","[OK] 벡터 430개 (차원 3072) - 조각 수와 일치\n","[OK] 벡터 저장소 : Chroma\n","[OK] BM25 색인 완료 · 토크나이저 : kiwipiepy(형태소)\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"2-9a0uj5_hG3"},"source":["## 6. 검색 엔진 만들기 (하이브리드 + 적합도 게이트)\n","\n","- **벡터 검색**(뜻이 비슷한 것) + **BM25**(단어가 일치하는 것) → **RRF**로 합칩니다\n","- **τ(타우) 게이트** : 가장 가까운 근거의 점수가 기준 미달이면 **문장을 만들지 않습니다**"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"HtoztD33_hG3","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787762475218,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":75,"user":{"displayName":"낑깡","userId":"05215753437445767806"}},"outputId":"ecca9810-c0f1-47a9-abc6-fc844603fab0"},"execution_count":46,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["✅ 검색 엔진 준비 완료\n"]}],"source":["TAU = 0.582                    # bge-m3 기준 · 무관 차단과 시연 통과의 중간값\n","TOP_K, FUSE_K = 5, 3\n","\n","def vec_search(q_emb, k=TOP_K):\n","    if BACKEND == \"Chroma\":\n","        r = col.query(query_embeddings=[q_emb.tolist()], n_results=k)\n","        ids = r[\"ids\"][0]\n","        idx = [next(i for i, c in enumerate(chunks) if c[\"id\"] == _id) for _id in ids]\n","        sims = [1 - d for d in r[\"distances\"][0]]\n","        return list(zip(idx, sims))\n","    sims = EMB @ q_emb\n","    idx = np.argsort(-sims)[:k]\n","    return [(int(i), float(sims[i])) for i in idx]\n","\n","def search(query):\n","    q_emb = embed([query], \"RETRIEVAL_QUERY\")[0]\n","    q_emb = q_emb / np.linalg.norm(q_emb)\n","\n","    v_hits = vec_search(q_emb)                      # [(idx, 코사인유사도)]\n","    b_scores = bm25.get_scores(tok(query))\n","    b_hits = [(int(i), float(b_scores[i])) for i in np.argsort(-b_scores)[:TOP_K]]\n","\n","    # RRF 융합\n","    rrf = {}\n","    for rank, (i, _) in enumerate(v_hits):  rrf[i] = rrf.get(i, 0) + 1/(60+rank)\n","    for rank, (i, _) in enumerate(b_hits):  rrf[i] = rrf.get(i, 0) + 1/(60+rank)\n","    fused = sorted(rrf.items(), key=lambda x: -x[1])[:FUSE_K]\n","\n","    cos = dict(v_hits)\n","    best_sim = max([cos.get(i, float(EMB[i] @ q_emb)) for i, _ in fused])\n","    results = [{\"chunk\": chunks[i], \"rrf\": s,\n","                \"sim\": float(cos.get(i, EMB[i] @ q_emb))} for i, s in fused]\n","    return results, best_sim\n","\n","print(\"✅ 검색 엔진 준비 완료\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"ElSvtbcN_hG4"},"source":["## 7. 시연 A — 규정에 **있는** 질문 → 근거를 붙여 스크립트 생성\n","\n","아래 `QUESTION` 을 규정집에 실제로 있는 내용으로 바꿔가며 돌려보세요."]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from pydantic import BaseModel\n","from typing import List\n","\n","class ScriptOut(BaseModel):\n","    stage: str\n","    script: str\n","    agent_note: str\n","    source_refs: List[str]\n","\n","SYSTEM = (\n"," \"너는 콜센터 상담사를 돕는 응대 스크립트 생성기다. \"\n"," \"제공된 [근거] 안의 내용만 사용하고 없는 사실을 지어내지 마라.\\n\"\n"," \"근거에는 두 종류가 섞여 있으니 반드시 구분하라 — \"\n"," \"(가) 상담사가 고객에게 그대로 말하는 「응대 예시문」, \"\n"," \"(나) 상담사가 따라야 할 절차 설명.\\n\"\n"," \"script : 고객에게 그대로 읽어줄 문장만 넣는다. 근거의 응대 예시문을 최대한 \"\n"," \"원문 그대로 쓰고, 절차·내부 규정 설명은 절대 넣지 마라.\\n\"\n"," \"agent_note : 상담사가 알아야 할 절차(다음 조치·보고·기록)를 한 문장으로.\\n\"\n"," \"stage : 근거에 단계 표기가 있으면 그 단계명, 없으면 '해당 없음'.\\n\"\n"," \"source_refs : 사용한 근거의 문서명과 쪽수.\")\n","\n","def answer(question):\n","    hits, best = search(question)\n","    print(f\"질문 : {question}\")\n","    print(f\"최고 적합도 : {best:.3f}   (기준 τ = {TAU})\")\n","    print(\"-\" * 62)\n","\n","    if best < TAU:\n","        print(\"🚫 규정 근거 없음 → 문장을 생성하지 않습니다\")\n","        print(\"   화면 표시 : “관련 규정을 찾지 못했습니다. 상급자 이관을 권장합니다.”\")\n","        return None\n","\n","    ctx = \"\\n\\n\".join(\n","        f\"[근거 {n+1}] ({h['chunk']['doc']} {h['chunk']['page']}쪽)\\n{h['chunk']['text']}\"\n","        for n, h in enumerate(hits))\n","    r = client.models.generate_content(\n","        model=GEN_MODEL,\n","        contents=f\"[근거]\\n{ctx}\\n\\n[고객 발화]\\n{question}\",\n","        config=types.GenerateContentConfig(\n","            system_instruction=SYSTEM, temperature=0.2,\n","            response_mime_type=\"application/json\", response_schema=ScriptOut))\n","    o = r.parsed\n","\n","    print(f\"📍 판정 단계 : {o.stage}\\n\")\n","    print(\"🗣  고객에게 읽어줄 문장\")\n","    print(f\"   “{o.script}”\\n\")\n","    print(\"📋 상담사 안내\")\n","    print(f\"   {o.agent_note}\\n\")\n","    print(\"📎 근거\")\n","    for s in o.source_refs: print(f\"   · {s}\")\n","    print(\"\\n🔎 검색된 근거 (상위 2건)\")\n","    for n, h in enumerate(hits[:2], 1):\n","        print(f\"   [{n}] {h['chunk']['page']}쪽 · 유사도 {h['sim']:.3f}\")\n","        print(f\"       {h['chunk']['text'][:90]}...\")\n","    return o\n","\n","QUESTION = \"고객이 30분째 같은 말을 반복하면서 욕을 합니다. 어떻게 해야 하나요?\"\n","_ = answer(QUESTION)"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"sqAuq1RRHVYl","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787762486481,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":3066,"user":{"displayName":"낑깡","userId":"05215753437445767806"}},"outputId":"1826982a-1f94-4efe-ef79-92375caec495"},"execution_count":47,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["질문 : 고객이 30분째 같은 말을 반복하면서 욕을 합니다. 어떻게 해야 하나요?\n","최고 적합도 : 0.600   (기준 τ = 0.582)\n","--------------------------------------------------------------\n","📍 판정 단계 : 3단계: 통화종료\n","\n","🗣  고객에게 읽어줄 문장\n","   “지금 고객님의 대화 내용은 녹음되고 있음을 알려드립니다. 고객님의 이런 말씀과 행동은 상대방에게 모욕감과 공포감을 일으키는 위법행위로서 관련 법령(형법 제283조 협박, 제311조 모욕죄)에 저촉될 수 있습니다. 자제를 부탁드립니다.”\n","\n","📋 상담사 안내\n","   폭언 중지를 3회 이상한 경우에도 폭언을 지속하면 응대가 불가능함을 설명하고 통화를 종료하며 소속 부서장에게 보고한다.\n","\n","📎 근거\n","   · [2021-사업총괄본부-694]_감정노동 종사자 건강보호 가이드(웹용) (1).pdf 39쪽\n","\n","🔎 검색된 근거 (상위 2건)\n","   [1] 73쪽 · 유사도 0.583\n","       함한 생각되나?” 있는 것이 아니라 허탈감(50)\n","일을 그만두고\n","모욕적인 언행을 “이런 대우를 문제는 전적으로 분노, 자괴감(70)\n","싶고, 그 고객을\n","일삼았으나,...\n","   [2] 39쪽 · 유사도 0.600\n","       을 전담하는\n","전담 관리반을 구성하도록 하고, 전담 관리반은 필요시 개입하여 담당하도록 한다.\n","응대 예시문\n","지금 고객님의 대화 내용은 녹음되고 있음을 알려드립니다....\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"Eol4Eur__hG4"},"source":["## 8. ★ 시연 B — 규정에 **없는** 질문 → **생성 거부**\n","\n","**이 셀의 출력이 기획서 캡처의 핵심입니다.**\n","\"AI가 지어내지 않는다\"를 말이 아니라 **화면으로** 증명하는 장면입니다."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"col